# Real questionnaire exports. These hold students' and alumni names and email
# addresses, so they stay on local machines. The tests that need them skip when
# they are absent.
Copy of *Questionnaire (Responses)*.csv
backend/tests/fixtures/mentor_responses.csv
backend/tests/fixtures/mentee_responses.csv

# Synthetic cohorts. Generated, so they contain no real person's details, but
# kept off the public repository all the same. The A and B pair is reproducible
# from the generator; the unlettered pair is a frozen snapshot the generator no
# longer writes, so keep a local copy of those two.
#
#     uv run python tests/fixtures/make_synthetic.py
#
# Tests that read them skip when they are absent, the same way the real exports
# behave.
Synthetic*Questionnaire (Responses)*.csv

# Sample malformed uploads, for checking input handling by hand. Nothing in the
# test suite reads them.
test-uploads/
